  "details": "1. Go to the default VRChat home world with friends.\n\n2. Grab pen in world and draw something.\n\n3. Grab the eraser in world and erase the drawing you made.\n\n4. Move the eraser away and back to the spot you removed the drawing.\n\n5. The outline of the removed drawing is seen locally and synced with other players.\n\nIf the user rejoins the world while other users are present, the drawing outline is still present for others but not for the person who rejoins the world.\n\nIf the user draws something without erasing it and leaves the world, other users can't remove the drawing they made as the outline isn't synced over to the host or next user.\n\nIf the user drops the eraser on the drawn or erased drawing and goes behind a wall it can also be seen.",
